words-hy.txt: the 3000 most frequent words counted by neoui's tools/make_wordlists.py in random main-namespace pages of hy.wikisource.org (public-domain works).
Only the counts were kept, no text: a list of common words with their frequency rank is a fact about the language,
so the list is the NeoSymbian Authors' own work.

